[ti:America the Beautiful]
[ar:Katharine Lee Bates (1895), music Samuel A. Ward (1882)]
[length:02:21]
[by:SingLearn - Nhom 10 (auto-aligned, faster-whisper)]
[00:01.24]O beautiful for pilgrim feet,
[00:17.78]Whose stern impassioned stress
[00:31.20]A thoroughfare for freedom beat
[00:44.62]Across the wilderness!
[00:58.04]America! America!
[01:02.10]God mend thine every flaw,
[01:12.90]Confirm thy soul in self-control,
[01:25.42]Thy liberty in law!
[01:35.98]And crown thy good with brotherhood
[01:48.78]From sea to shining sea!
[02:20.00]
